      "id": "WFR01",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: workflow-canvas presentation branch",
      "from": "DiagramPage / ItemsPage节点集合",
      "to": "节点容器Canvas与独立连线Visual层",
      "behavior": "DiagramPage.GetContainerForItemOverride创建DiagramItem并交HostPanel=hostPanal、ConnectionPanel=_adornerLayer、ItemDiagramPage=this；ItemsPanel本地声明Canvas IsItemsHost，Canvas_Initialized保存hostPanal。DiagramItem原元数据基类ListViewItem，Connection基类Shape，均与工具结果TextShape/ShapeCanvas分属不同控件链。DiagramPage构造AddVisualChild(_adornerLayer)，VisualChildrenCount=2，GetVisualChild(0)返回Child，其它index返回_adornerLayer；Measure/Arrange另处理该层。",
