    {
      "id": "WFR02",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: workflow-canvas presentation branch",
      "from": "DiagramItem.DataContext / DisplayType",
      "to": "装饰器与默认/专用模板选择",
      "behavior": "DataContext不是IDecorate时，依IVmProcedure/IVMGroup/其它创建对应VmProcedureDecorator/VmGroupDecorator/VmModuleDecorator。DiagramItem静态元数据设默认StyleKey；原BAML解码且与本地byte-equal的diagramitemtemplate声明默认NORMAL，DisplayType绑定装饰器；FUNCTION/TIMER选择Square，PROCESS与PROCESSADORNER选择PROCESS，GROUP与GROUPADORNER选择GROUP，NONE选择空模板。MODULE分类Convert/缓存/参数入口已在既有display-type-review及plugin-sessions逐边；此处不重新解释为全部类型同一种节点。",
