          "start": 532,
          "end": 560,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate void DiagramItem_DataContextChanged(object sender, DependencyPropertyChangedEventArgs e)\n\t{\n\t\tif (!(DataContext is IDecorate))\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (e.NewValue is IVmProcedure)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tDataContext = new VmProcedureDecorator\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tDecorateSource = e.NewValue\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\telse if (e.NewValue is IVMGroup)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tDataContext = new VmGroupDecorator\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tDecorateSource = e.NewValue\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tDataContext = new VmModuleDecorator\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tDecorateSource = e.NewValue\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tforeach (Connection item in from p in ConnectionPanel.Children.OfType<Connection>()\n\t\t\t\twhere p.TargetItem == null\n\t\t\t\tselect p)\n\t\t\t{",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
