      "from": "Connection.SetPath / DefiningGeometry",
      "to": "单Shape内折线和闭合箭头PathGeometry",
      "behavior": "构造将polyLineSegment加入非闭合且不填充的figureOfPolyline，将arrowSegment加入闭合figureOfArrow，两图形加入geometry。SourceIndex/TargetIndex绑定，PathPoints为TwoWay。SetPath(IList<Point>)用首点为起点、其余为PointCollection，取倒数第二点至末点构箭头向量，旋转计算箭头后InvalidateVisual；DefiningGeometry直接返回该geometry。该方法没有少于两点/重复末点守卫，不能凭图形能画证明输入总合法。",
      "refs": [
