        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/Connection.xaml.cs",
          "member": "Polyline and arrow figure initialization",
          "sha256": "cc185a2b2b8a30013b3914d6abf8fbe02f59ff0a590660f3a292d8dcfd2f25a7",
          "start": 306,
          "end": 330,
          "excerpt": "\tpublic Connection(DiagramPage diagramPage)\n\t{\n\t\tInitializeComponent();\n\t\tPage = diagramPage;\n\t\tfigureOfPolyline.Segments.Add(polyLineSegment);\n\t\tfigureOfPolyline.IsClosed = false;\n\t\tfigureOfPolyline.IsFilled = false;\n\t\tgeometry.Figures.Add(figureOfPolyline);\n\t\tfigureOfArrow.Segments.Add(arrowSegment);\n\t\tfigureOfArrow.IsClosed = true;\n\t\tgeometry.Figures.Add(figureOfArrow);\n\t\tFocusable = true;\n\t\tSetBinding(SourceIndexProperty, \"SourceIndex\");\n\t\tSetBinding(TargetIndexProperty, \"TargetIndex\");\n\t\tSetBinding(PathPointsProperty, new Binding(\"PathPoints\")\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tMode = BindingMode.TwoWay\n\t\t});\n\t\thoverPotDelegate = new HoverPotDelegate();\n\t\thoverPotDelegate.SetBinding(HoverPotDelegate.ItemsSourceProperty, new Binding(\"MidPoints\")\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tSource = this\n\t\t});\n\t\tRequestBringIntoView += Connection_RequestBringIntoView;\n\t}",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/Connection.xaml.cs",
          "member": "Polyline and arrow geometry",
          "sha256": "cc185a2b2b8a30013b3914d6abf8fbe02f59ff0a590660f3a292d8dcfd2f25a7",
          "start": 754,
          "end": 778,
          "excerpt": "\tpublic void SetPath(IList<Point> linePoints)\n\t{\n\t\tfigureOfPolyline.StartPoint = linePoints.First();\n\t\tpolyLineSegment.Points = new PointCollection(linePoints.Skip(1));\n\t\tdouble num = 10.0;\n\t\tVector vector = linePoints[linePoints.Count - 2] - linePoints.Last();\n\t\tList<Point> list = new List<Point>();\n\t\tPoint point = linePoints.Last();\n\t\tvector.Normalize();\n\t\tvector *= num;\n\t\tdouble num2 = Math.Atan2(8.0, 5.0) * 180.0 / Math.PI;\n\t\tdouble num3 = Math.Sqrt(89.0);\n\t\tvector.Normalize();\n\t\tPoint point2 = point + 6.0 * vector;\n\t\tMatrix matrix = default;\n\t\tmatrix.Rotate(90.0);\n\t\tfigureOfArrow.StartPoint = point2 + 5.0 * vector * matrix;\n\t\tmatrix.Rotate(180.0 - num2);\n\t\tlist.Add(figureOfArrow.StartPoint + num3 * vector * matrix);\n\t\tmatrix.Rotate(2.0 * num2);\n\t\tlist.Add(list.First() + num3 * vector * matrix);\n\t\tarrowSegment.Points = new PointCollection(list);\n\t\tInvalidateVisual();\n\t}\n",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "WPF内部stroke/栅格化、零向量和非法路径实际可达性、所有连接样式仍未知；不涉及工具算法图像像素。"
      ],
      "operationComplete": false
    },
