          "start": 353,
          "end": 383,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate void OnIsSelectedChanged()\n\t{\n\t\tif (IsFocused)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tList<Point> list = new List<Point>();\n\t\t\tGetCleanLinePoint(list);\n\t\t\tMidPoints.Clear();\n\t\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < list.Count - 1; i++)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tPoint point = list[i];\n\t\t\t\tPoint point2 = list[i + 1];\n\t\t\t\tif (new Vector(point2.X - point.X, point2.Y - point.Y).Length > 5.0)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tHoverPotData hoverPotData = new HoverPotData\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tStartIndex = i,\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIsHorizon = (point2.Y == point.Y),\n\t\t\t\t\t\tpoint = new Point((point2.X + point.X) / 2.0, (point2.Y + point.Y) / 2.0)\n\t\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t\t\thoverPotData.MouseDownCommand = (ICommand)new DelegateCommand<object>((Action<object>)MouseDownExecute);\n\t\t\t\t\tMidPoints.Add(hoverPotData);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\telse\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tMidPoints.Clear();\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tprivate void connectionUserControl_LostFocus(object sender, RoutedEventArgs e)",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
